  m_Text: 'Action                Key

    Move                  W A S D

    Jump                  Space

    Duck                  Left Ctrl

    Walk (silent)         Left Shift

    Attack                Mouse Left

    Zoom (AWP / Scout)    Mouse Right

    Reload                R

    Drop weapon           G

    Switch weapon         1 ~ 5

    Use / plant / defuse  E (hold)

    Buy menu              B

    Scoreboard            Tab (hold)

    Bot / quick menu      H

    Radio                 Z / X / C

    Console               / or Num0

    Pause menu            Esc'
